This is a desk accessory for the Macintosh that blacks out the screen and
bounces an apple character randomly about until the mouse is clicked.  It is
intended for those who like to leave their Macs on forever and would rather
the display were not burned into the screen.

The accessory is imbedded within an installer program (the traditional SUMacC
"Desk" program).  You can install it using this program or RMOVER, whichever
makes you more comfortable.  The file is in fromhex format.

